highlight.js (custom build)
Version: 11.11.1
Licence: BSD-3-Clause
Source:  https://www.npmjs.com/package/highlight.js (LICENSE from the highlight.js@11.11.1 package)

This file (highlight.min.js) is NOT the upstream distributable — it is a
custom bundle built from highlight.js's own source (`highlight.js/lib/core`
plus the `bash`, `json` and `go` language grammars and the `plaintext`
fallback, the only languages the shipped docs fence), produced locally with
esbuild and vendored here so the site never fetches highlighting from a CDN.
Rebuild it by installing highlight.js@11.11.1 and running esbuild against an
entry file that imports the same core + languages listed above with
`--bundle --minify --format=iife`, exposing the result as `window.hljs`.

